# Standalone tools first

When changing the accessibility checker or the search engine ranker:

1. Update the standalone GitHub repo first:
   - `https://github.com/jorgepaezdev/accessibility-checker`
   - `https://github.com/jorgepaezdev/search-engine-tracker`
2. Then copy the same product change onto `https://github.com/jorgepaezdev/website` (the `/accessibility-checker` and `/search-engine-ranking-tool` pages).
3. Never change the website copy of a tool without updating the standalone repo first.
4. Sync exclusively with GitHub. Never use Origin.
